  "scope": "Full written characterization of actual high-region returns and a sharp bound of three consecutive two-step returns, including small widths. Five Lean theorems certify only the necessary 900-state graph rank; the actual-map bridge remains written. Root read the proof and independent reviews. Two generators agree on all 1,800 controls and 900 ranks; an independent literal-integer audit and sink-deletion rank check passed. The actual sharp seed 80999 is verified.",
