    "The sharp witness reaches a palindrome at positive time two; it proves high-region sharpness, not sharpness for three safe returns.",
    "The theorem does not exclude later returns after leaving the region or other persistent safety mechanisms.",
    "Sharpness for three safe returns remains UNKNOWN; every failed explicit completion is retained.",
    "The preliminary 1,111 controls are recovered exact outcomes, distinguished from the original command output."
